# Local run listens on 8080 (set PORT to change it). Sample documents are in samples/.

### Upload a document (indexed in the background)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="aurelia-annual-report-2025.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/aurelia-annual-report-2025.pdf
--boundary--

### Documents and their indexing status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/documents

### Ask a question
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What was the CET1 ratio at the end of 2025?"}

### Follow-up in the same conversation (use the conversationId of the previous answer)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "And how does it compare with the target?", "conversationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}

### Stream the answer (Server-Sent Events)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"question": "How did net interest income evolve in 2025?"}

### Messages of a conversation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
